/mvnw text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# The Maven wrapper ships its batch file with CRLF endings and it is committed as-is. Declaring it
# `text` keeps the index LF while HEAD holds the CRLF blob, so every checkout reports the file as
# modified. The exemption must come last: the last matching pattern wins per attribute.
/mvnw.cmd -text
